     A          R HAULIST
     A                                  1  2'Help - Authorized users'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'These people may look at your cale-
     A                                      ndar (View) or change it (Change).'
     A                                  5  3'The first line covers everyone who-
     A                                       is not listed.  Normally they may -
     A                                      look'
     A                                  6  3'but not change.'
     A                                  8  3'Type Y or N in the View and Change-
     A                                       columns and press Enter to save.'
     A                                  9  3'Type 4 beside a person to take the-
     A                                      m off the list.  F6 adds a person.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
